WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.230
<b>Nakaritsuhara High School</b>

00:00.570 --> 00:02.920
<i>One afternoon in the not-so-distant past,</i>

00:02.920 --> 00:07.230
<i>several days before Misumi Makoto 
traveled to the isekai.</i>

00:08.350 --> 00:09.540
Misumi-kun.

00:13.300 --> 00:15.070
Otonashi-senpai.

00:16.480 --> 00:21.590
Sorry, but the documents we just handed out 
at the student council meeting are dated wrong.

00:21.590 --> 00:22.950
Could you swap these for yours?

00:22.950 --> 00:26.210
Sure. Thank you.

00:26.930 --> 00:28.670
<i>Misumi Makoto-kun...</i>

00:29.210 --> 00:32.470
<i>I heard he's the average "hero" 
who snuck into the archery club</i>

00:32.470 --> 00:37.110
<i>that's otherwise full of beauties, 
but he doesn't seem like much of a hero.</i>

00:38.090 --> 00:41.050
<i>I might be a little jealous, though.</i>

00:41.990 --> 00:45.690
<i>I could always do everything 
with minimal effort.</i>

00:45.690 --> 00:49.510
<i>I doubt I'll ever try my 
best or fail at anything.</i>

00:49.510 --> 00:53.160
<i>Everything will probably go well for me.</i>

00:54.370 --> 00:56.620
<i>My life is smooth sailing.</i>

00:57.540 --> 00:59.690
<i>It's boring.</i>

01:09.420 --> 01:11.960
<i>Or so I thought.</i>

01:34.990 --> 01:37.530
<b>Season Two</b>

02:42.180 --> 02:46.470
<b>Night Two    The Heroes Are a Couple of Beauties</b>

02:42.180 --> 02:46.470
<b>Night Two    The Heroes Are a Couple of Beauties</b>

02:44.720 --> 02:46.180
What is this place?

02:47.620 --> 02:50.370
You're Otonashi Hibiki, are you not?

02:51.540 --> 02:54.130
Yes. Who are you?

02:54.130 --> 02:56.310
I am the goddess of another world.

02:56.870 --> 03:02.830
The world I protect is currently under 
unprecedented threat from evil demons.

03:03.180 --> 03:06.060
I'd like your help.

03:07.180 --> 03:12.050
I'm planning to send you and one 
other to my world as heroes.

03:12.050 --> 03:15.010
Please guide the hyumans.

03:15.330 --> 03:18.210
I shall grant you as much power as I can.

03:20.150 --> 03:21.760
Could you ask someone else?

03:22.150 --> 03:26.250
I've got a decent number of friends, 
and my life is going well.

03:26.570 --> 03:31.100
Do you really want to live 
an easy life with friends

03:31.100 --> 03:34.020
who you can neither relate to 
nor share your feelings with?

03:34.700 --> 03:36.620
What are you trying to say?

03:36.620 --> 03:39.220
Your current world is too 
restrictive for you.

03:39.580 --> 03:44.500
Don't you actually long for a challenging 
existence where you risk your life

03:44.500 --> 03:46.900
alongside a companion you 
trust to watch your back?

03:47.700 --> 03:48.840
I...

03:50.260 --> 03:52.780
Then it's decided, Otonashi Hibiki.

03:53.500 --> 03:57.770
I shall grant you powerful magical abilities,
 increased physical abilities,

03:57.770 --> 04:00.360
and the charisma to draw people to you.

04:00.360 --> 04:03.060
I shall also grant you this sacred treasure.

04:04.780 --> 04:07.060
A silver sash?

04:07.320 --> 04:10.360
So begins the divine trial.

04:10.360 --> 04:12.810
I know you'll be able to overcome it.

04:12.810 --> 04:14.360
I have high hopes for you.

04:18.270 --> 04:21.740
<b></b>Limia Kingdom

04:18.270 --> 04:21.740
<b></b>Limia Kingdom

04:22.400 --> 04:24.820
We've received a divine revelation?

04:24.820 --> 04:25.450
Yes.

04:25.760 --> 04:29.150
"I shall grant you a hero. 
Defeat the demons."

04:29.410 --> 04:33.510
I thought the goddess had abandoned us,

04:33.510 --> 04:37.210
but now Limia will be safe from demons.

04:44.820 --> 04:46.400
So this is her.

04:46.400 --> 04:48.510
This is your hero.

04:48.510 --> 04:50.280
The rest is in your hands.

04:50.280 --> 04:52.050
What? That's the only 
explanation you're giving?!

04:52.580 --> 04:53.800
Thank you!

04:53.800 --> 04:55.230
Hero!

04:55.230 --> 04:58.880
<i>I-Is this really another world?</i>

04:58.880 --> 05:01.190
<i>But in my case,</i>

05:01.460 --> 05:05.850
<i>nobody came to meet me, and I was left 
wandering in a deserted wasteland.</i>

05:06.820 --> 05:09.310
I wonder how many days have 
passed since I came here.

05:11.490 --> 05:13.780
It looks just like Japan.

05:14.130 --> 05:15.640
The demons were forced into

05:15.640 --> 05:19.890
a barren land by the hyumans, 
who received the goddess's protection,

05:19.890 --> 05:21.910
but over the past decade, 
they've expanded their territory.

05:22.350 --> 05:24.870
The great nation of Elysion 
has already been destroyed,

05:24.870 --> 05:30.720
but the allied Limia Kingdom and Gritonia 
Empire are holding the last line of defense.

05:31.670 --> 05:33.860
The Gritonia Empire, huh?

05:34.840 --> 05:36.580
There's another hero?

05:36.580 --> 05:37.140
Yes.

05:37.500 --> 05:41.280
So the stories about the empire 
acquiring a hero are true.

05:41.280 --> 05:43.560
But why was one sent to that nation?

05:44.660 --> 05:50.850
I guess it'd be stranger if two great 
neighboring nations got along.

05:51.500 --> 05:54.860
Once the war against demons ends...

05:55.830 --> 05:58.290
I'll have to give it considerable thought.

05:58.630 --> 06:00.220
Hey, are you listening?

06:01.440 --> 06:03.390
Then come on out.

06:05.220 --> 06:08.840
<i>I was surprised to learn there was a 
wolf spirit in this sacred treasure.</i>

06:09.320 --> 06:13.710
Anyway, tomorrow I'll select party 
members from among the mercenaries.

06:14.180 --> 06:16.310
At the king's recommendation,

06:16.310 --> 06:22.240
Court Mage Woody and the promising new
knight Verda have already been selected.

06:23.000 --> 06:25.160
Sounds like they pulled some strings.

06:26.500 --> 06:27.470
Is that really her?

06:27.470 --> 06:29.020
She's beautiful.

06:29.480 --> 06:30.900
So that's the hero, huh?

06:31.360 --> 06:33.610
She's trim and doesn't have 
a whiff of blood about her.

06:33.880 --> 06:36.350
She's a flower not meant 
for the battlefield.

06:37.580 --> 06:39.770
You're leaving?

06:40.810 --> 06:45.040
If it isn't Court Mage Woody, 
Limia's Mobile Battery.

06:45.410 --> 06:49.560
I'm not fond of that nickname, 
Naval the Silver-Haired Ogre.

06:49.840 --> 06:52.810
I've had enough of protecting 
precious honor students.

06:52.810 --> 06:55.250
All I care about is killing demons.

06:55.250 --> 06:56.690
Later.

06:56.690 --> 06:58.100
Wait.

06:58.730 --> 07:00.860
I could tell as soon as I saw you.

07:00.860 --> 07:03.890
You're the strongest one here, aren't you?

07:04.500 --> 07:07.070
I need a master to teach me to wield a sword

07:07.070 --> 07:10.930
and a partner I can trust to watch 
my back on the battlefield.

07:10.930 --> 07:12.950
I'd like you to do it.

07:13.310 --> 07:18.950
I can't trust someone who needs to 
be taught how to wield a sword.

07:19.480 --> 07:21.820
I thought you only cared 
about killing demons.

07:22.220 --> 07:25.960
If you come with me, you'll be able to fight 
all the demons you want on the front lines.

07:26.250 --> 07:28.200
You won't be bored.

07:28.200 --> 07:30.260
Doesn't that sound better 
than refusing my request

07:30.260 --> 07:32.940
and having a difficult time 
staying in this country?

07:34.370 --> 07:35.640
Fine.

07:35.910 --> 07:38.590
<i>Hibiki the Hero is truly beautiful.</i>

07:39.100 --> 07:42.380
<i>I shall stand at her side.</i>

07:42.600 --> 07:45.100
<i>But in my case,</i>

07:45.100 --> 07:48.350
<i>I won the affection of a dragon 
obsessed with historical dramas.</i>

07:48.360 --> 07:51.610
<b></b>Limia Border Neutral Zone

07:48.360 --> 07:51.610
<b></b>Limia Border Neutral Zone

07:51.120 --> 07:52.820
They're late.

07:53.060 --> 07:55.550
This is why I don't like escort jobs.

07:55.550 --> 07:59.230
Now, now. The Priestess of Laurel 
is honoring us with a visit.

07:59.570 --> 08:01.960
B-Bad news! It's the priestess's carriage!

08:02.830 --> 08:05.830
Stay where you are, everyone.

08:06.070 --> 08:07.800
Kobolds, huh?

08:09.120 --> 08:12.150
They're monsters who become stronger 
by consuming powerful mana.

08:12.150 --> 08:15.270
Despite their appearance, 
they're actually quite strong.

08:15.270 --> 08:17.920
I'm impressed by the Priestess 
of Laurel, though.

08:17.920 --> 08:22.350
That magical barrier will easily last 
until the kobolds have been finished off.

08:22.820 --> 08:23.850
Four, huh?

08:23.850 --> 08:26.390
We'll each take down one at the same time.

08:26.390 --> 08:31.340
If you're not careful, they'll call for help.

08:32.290 --> 08:36.640
Hibiki, have you never 
killed a monster before?

08:37.510 --> 08:39.030
It's fine. I can do it.

08:50.630 --> 08:52.550
<i>Too shallow. I'll hit it again.</i>

08:53.290 --> 08:55.190
S-Spare me...

08:56.350 --> 08:58.010
Th-They can speak?

09:01.340 --> 09:03.420
Hibiki, what are you doing?

09:05.550 --> 09:07.010
Mana!

09:07.010 --> 09:07.580
Strong!

09:07.580 --> 09:08.480
This isn't good!

09:08.480 --> 09:09.950
Want!

09:08.710 --> 09:10.450
They've summoned allies.

09:10.450 --> 09:12.410
Hibiki, stand back!

09:15.540 --> 09:17.990
It's no use. The magical barrier won't hold.

09:22.010 --> 09:25.890
<i>Because I hesitated...</i>

09:27.240 --> 09:29.910
<i>Help me, Hero.</i>

09:38.270 --> 09:42.820
I am the hero who will end this war!

09:43.170 --> 09:46.020
I can't stop here!

09:47.750 --> 09:50.180
Let's go! Follow Hibiki's lead!

09:58.200 --> 10:00.770
That was pretty good for your first time.

10:01.510 --> 10:05.080
Hero, thank you for saving us.

10:05.700 --> 10:09.240
I am Chiya, Priestess of Laurel.

10:09.240 --> 10:13.070
Please allow me to join your party.

10:13.070 --> 10:15.040
I'd like to help you.

10:16.380 --> 10:18.520
D-Don't be absurd.

10:18.520 --> 10:23.640
Running off with their priestess would cause 
friction with the Laurel Commonwealth.

10:28.030 --> 10:29.350
What?

10:29.350 --> 10:34.650
I-If the people of Laurel see this hair, 
they'll think Limia did something to me.

10:35.530 --> 10:36.570
Seriously?

10:36.570 --> 10:37.980
Unbelievable.

10:37.980 --> 10:39.370
We'd lose our heads.

10:39.370 --> 10:44.330
I will fight with the hero to end this war!

10:44.330 --> 10:46.800
That threat doesn't make sense.

10:47.390 --> 10:50.170
You ruined your beautiful hair.

10:50.170 --> 10:52.620
It may suit a priestess who 
serves as mere decoration,

10:52.620 --> 10:54.780
but it would get in the 
way on the battlefield.

10:54.780 --> 10:55.710
Oh.

10:56.370 --> 10:59.040
Then maybe I'll chop mine off, too.

10:59.040 --> 11:00.210
Me, too.

11:00.210 --> 11:04.460
No! You two are really strong, 
so you don't need to cut yours!

11:09.040 --> 11:11.070
Don't call yourself decoration.

11:11.070 --> 11:13.110
Your magical barrier was incredible.

11:14.810 --> 11:19.080
Could you teach me to use magic, Chiya-chan?

11:21.330 --> 11:22.300
Sure!

11:23.640 --> 11:28.610
<i>After that, we defeated the demons 
in one battle after another,</i>

11:28.610 --> 11:30.490
<i>never losing a single time.</i>

11:32.750 --> 11:34.830
<i>Until we met that thing.</i>

11:38.770 --> 11:41.370
What is this monster?

11:41.370 --> 11:43.630
The Black Spider of Disaster.

11:43.630 --> 11:46.680
It consumes everything it encounters,
 whether person or thing.

11:47.210 --> 11:48.840
The vanguard is finished.

11:49.280 --> 11:52.760
I didn't expect to run into anything 
on the way to the battlefield.

11:52.760 --> 11:56.560
Normally, all you can do 
is wait for it to pass.

11:56.560 --> 11:58.770
True to its name, it's a disaster.

12:08.380 --> 12:11.420
Damn. I even had Chiya cast a 
strengthening spell on me, too.

12:13.200 --> 12:14.710
Its attacks are heavy.

12:17.180 --> 12:18.500
And my magic isn't working.

12:20.400 --> 12:21.880
There has to be a limit...

12:22.320 --> 12:23.710
to how hard...

12:24.330 --> 12:25.580
something can be!

12:26.690 --> 12:27.880
We did it!

12:29.850 --> 12:31.300
What?

12:31.300 --> 12:33.140
It regenerated...

12:35.010 --> 12:35.860
Hibiki!

12:37.300 --> 12:38.260
Naval!

12:42.450 --> 12:43.650
Let go of her!

12:47.470 --> 12:48.910
Chiya-chan, heal her!

12:48.910 --> 12:49.770
Got it.

12:49.770 --> 12:50.770
I'll assist—

13:03.900 --> 13:06.750
I can still fight! Come at me!

13:23.450 --> 13:26.530
<i>Am I going to die?</i>

13:35.220 --> 13:37.200
Horn, where are the others?

13:41.620 --> 13:44.370
Thank goodness! They're all right!

13:47.700 --> 13:52.550
<i>I had no idea fighting my hardest 
and losing would be so frustrating.</i>

13:55.030 --> 13:59.010
Thank you for this defeat, 
Black Spider of Disaster.

13:59.670 --> 14:01.920
Next time, I'll win.

14:04.890 --> 14:07.110
<i>One afternoon in the not-so-distant past,</i>

14:07.110 --> 14:11.750
<i>several days after Otonashi Hibiki
traveled to the isekai.</i>

14:12.130 --> 14:14.710
We heard you're a model.

14:14.710 --> 14:16.620
Give us some spare change, will you?

14:17.790 --> 14:19.250
N-No.

14:19.670 --> 14:22.200
What was that? We didn't hear you.

14:23.530 --> 14:25.690
<i>Why is this happening to me?</i>

14:26.220 --> 14:28.440
<i>I didn't do anything to them.</i>

14:29.630 --> 14:32.770
Are you guys bullying Tomoki-kun again?

14:34.790 --> 14:36.720
You're pathetic.

14:37.240 --> 14:38.640
I...

14:39.120 --> 14:40.840
I'm not being bullied.

14:41.800 --> 14:44.930
Beautiful fragile boys 
are great, aren't they?

14:49.360 --> 14:50.990
Damn it. Seriously?

14:54.550 --> 14:56.920
<i>Things don't even go well for me in games.</i>

14:56.910 --> 15:00.870
<b>Reincarnated and Maxing Out Enchanting 
to Live an Overpowered Max Stats Life</b>

14:58.470 --> 15:00.880
<i>An overpowered ability in an isekai, huh?</i>

15:01.530 --> 15:07.340
<i>If I had an OP ability and 
lived somewhere else, then...</i>

15:12.850 --> 15:15.750
Huh? What is this place? Am I dreaming?

15:17.060 --> 15:19.570
You're Iwahashi Tomoki, are you not?

15:19.570 --> 15:20.240
Who are you?

15:20.570 --> 15:22.850
I am the goddess of another world.

15:22.850 --> 15:23.700
Huh?

15:24.200 --> 15:27.310
The world I protect is 
overflowing with monsters.

15:27.310 --> 15:30.460
I can no longer handle 
the problem on my own.

15:30.850 --> 15:35.280
Please become a hero and save my world.

15:35.660 --> 15:36.940
A hero?

15:37.490 --> 15:39.250
Don't worry.

15:39.620 --> 15:42.600
I plan to send another hero,

15:42.600 --> 15:45.900
and I shall bless you with power, as well.

15:45.900 --> 15:47.210
What kind of power?

15:47.570 --> 15:52.420
A body capable of fighting beasts, 
and magic to overwhelm demons.

15:52.420 --> 15:56.400
I shall also grant you the skill Magic Eye,
 which allows you to enthrall others,

15:57.670 --> 16:02.220
and silver shoes that will allow you to fly 
through the skies and relieve your exhaustion.

16:03.080 --> 16:06.230
<i>Wow. They're all overpowered.</i>

16:06.230 --> 16:07.560
<i>But I must be dreaming,</i>

16:08.810 --> 16:10.020
<i>so I might as well ask...</i>

16:10.290 --> 16:12.120
Th-That's all?

16:12.590 --> 16:15.970
In that case, though this 
will be a slight burden,

16:15.970 --> 16:19.250
I shall make you immortal at night.

16:19.500 --> 16:23.720
However, this ability will only 
function while the moon is out.

16:24.170 --> 16:29.680
Could you also change my appearance 
to anything I desire?

16:29.680 --> 16:31.320
Of course.

16:33.190 --> 16:35.100
Thank you, Goddess.

16:35.820 --> 16:39.050
I'll do my best to act as your hero.

16:39.940 --> 16:41.590
I'm counting on you.

16:53.420 --> 16:55.870
So this is the goddess's world.

16:57.820 --> 17:00.790
Are you the hero?

17:01.860 --> 17:03.650
Uh, yeah.

17:04.120 --> 17:05.750
Good.

17:06.170 --> 17:08.840
I am Lily Flont Gritonia.

17:09.280 --> 17:12.170
I am the second princess of Gritonia.

17:12.170 --> 17:15.430
I'm Iwahashi. Iwahashi Tomoki.

17:16.000 --> 17:18.710
This is not the place for a conversation.

17:21.330 --> 17:24.600
Will you come with me?

17:26.040 --> 17:27.070
Okay.

17:29.040 --> 17:30.020
Your Highness.

17:30.520 --> 17:33.110
Was the goddess's revelation true?

17:33.110 --> 17:33.980
Yes.

17:33.980 --> 17:37.470
This is the hero, Iwahashi Tomoki-sama.

17:38.710 --> 17:44.650
Hero, this is Ginebia of the royal guard, 
who are our highest-ranking knights.

17:44.870 --> 17:47.750
Wow! This is my first time 
seeing a lady knight.

17:47.750 --> 17:48.360
Wha...

17:49.030 --> 17:51.720
You may be the hero, but how rude of you!

17:53.890 --> 17:54.830
Sorry.

17:55.740 --> 17:56.800
It's fine.

17:56.800 --> 18:02.950
Um, I'd appreciate it if 
you didn't stare so much.

18:06.050 --> 18:11.420
Hero, I'd like to examine your suitability 
for equipment and measure your level.

18:11.420 --> 18:12.200
This way, please.

18:12.200 --> 18:12.970
Level?

18:13.840 --> 18:16.160
This world has levels?

18:18.220 --> 18:19.900
I'm exhausted.

18:20.450 --> 18:23.910
I'll have some servants show you
around the castle later.

18:23.910 --> 18:25.670
You can relax here for a while.

18:30.670 --> 18:32.320
What are his results?

18:32.320 --> 18:36.080
It's probably a type of magical eye 
specialized for charming others.

18:36.390 --> 18:41.100
Then take measures to make myself and the 
imperial family immune to its effects.

18:41.100 --> 18:44.050
Tell no one about his abilities.

18:44.320 --> 18:45.160
Yes, Your Highness.

18:46.970 --> 18:51.740
The hero's innocence doesn't 
sit right with me.

18:54.060 --> 18:54.730
Lily?

18:55.330 --> 18:57.180
You're the hero?

18:57.180 --> 18:58.200
Huh? Who are you?

18:58.200 --> 19:01.300
This is Yukinatsu the alchemist.

19:01.690 --> 19:03.930
She apparently wanted to speak with you.

19:03.200 --> 19:06.750
I may be an alchemist, 
but I don't make medicines.

19:06.750 --> 19:10.910
I'm a force player. I'm skilled in 
controlling and constructing golems.

19:11.180 --> 19:13.600
Golems? You can make golems?

19:14.520 --> 19:15.540
What kinds of golems?

19:17.730 --> 19:21.840
Hero, I hear you're able to use all 
of the empire's magical equipment.

19:21.840 --> 19:25.710
I'd love to chat with you about it. 
You should come to my room tonight.

19:26.140 --> 19:27.180
Yukinatsu.

19:27.700 --> 19:30.260
S-Sorry. I couldn't help myself.

19:30.640 --> 19:33.500
We'll speak another day.

19:36.880 --> 19:38.280
A magic eye, huh?

19:43.350 --> 19:44.540
A dragon?

19:45.730 --> 19:47.580
Who are you, mister?

19:48.090 --> 19:51.200
I'm Tomoki. I'm supposed to be the hero.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.670
The hero?

19:53.210 --> 19:56.870
I'm Mora. I'm a dragon summoner.

19:57.210 --> 19:58.480
Oh?

19:58.480 --> 20:01.080
Don't judge me by my looks, okay?

20:01.390 --> 20:04.640
I'll have you know I'm the 
greatest of all tamers.

20:04.640 --> 20:06.060
I see.

20:06.310 --> 20:08.970
Does your whole family live in the castle?

20:09.400 --> 20:15.660
No. Her Highness Princess Lily brought me 
here after my village was attacked by demons.

20:16.330 --> 20:18.800
Sorry. I didn't know.

20:20.000 --> 20:24.400
It's fine. But in exchange, 
will you marry me?

20:24.400 --> 20:25.600
Huh?

20:25.600 --> 20:29.690
Um, I just want you to join my family.

20:29.690 --> 20:32.870
Or, you know, be my f-friend.

20:34.500 --> 20:36.570
Sure. Thanks.

20:40.750 --> 20:42.800
You want to form a party 
with the three of them?

20:43.270 --> 20:49.330
Th-They'll get the chance to work 
closely with me. Not a bad deal, right?

20:49.720 --> 20:51.260
You're right.

20:51.540 --> 20:57.140
Ginebia, Yukinatsu, and Mora
 all seem to like you.

20:57.450 --> 20:58.620
Like me?

20:59.490 --> 21:04.900
<i>It looks like he hasn't learned 
to control his magic eye yet.</i>

21:06.030 --> 21:10.560
Lily, what did you think 
of me when we first met?

21:10.560 --> 21:15.900
I knew at first glance that 
you'd be the one to lead us.

21:15.900 --> 21:19.470
You make a fantastic hero.

21:20.990 --> 21:24.170
It's only natural that everyone likes you.

21:25.160 --> 21:27.840
I shall gladly support you, as well.

21:29.000 --> 21:30.440
Lily...

21:30.440 --> 21:34.740
<i>If I become the perfect hero,</i>

21:35.110 --> 21:38.660
<i>then the power of the magic 
eye will hardly be an issue.</i>

21:44.160 --> 21:48.730
<i>I'll give anything if it leads to 
the destruction of the demons,</i>

21:48.730 --> 21:55.070
<i>for my mother, who believed in that 
capricious goddess until the end.</i>

21:56.290 --> 21:58.590
<i>But in my case,</i>

21:58.910 --> 22:03.230
<i>I was kissed passionately 
by the Black Spider.</i>

23:36.170 --> 23:39.180
<i>Night Three: "Stellar Wars."</i>

23:36.390 --> 23:40.010
<b>Next Time</b>

23:37.390 --> 23:40.010
<b>Stellar Wars</b>
